Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.09,0:00:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.47,0:01:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mr. Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Taya, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.13,0:01:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's upstairs getting ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.75,0:01:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call him for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no thanks. We're already late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.15,0:01:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, Taya's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.59,0:01:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.63,0:01:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This new chain ought to keep\Nmy Millennium Puzzle safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.51,0:01:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like everyone wants\Ntheir hands on it lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.89,0:01:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're going to need\Nit now more than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We are?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.41,0:01:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.11,0:01:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Puzzle connects us, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And I sense fate has more in store for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're in this\Ntogether no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.65,0:01:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew more, but our\Nfuture is still unclear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll help you figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,About time, Yugi. Sorry, Thea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to be late for the big game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.83,0:01:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:01:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I was talking to the spirit\Nof the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.93,0:02:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems kind of worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.39,0:02:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,About the future, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.73,0:02:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He said something about\Nour destiny being unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.97,0:02:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since we defeated Pegasus together,\Nthe spirit's been talking about fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.27,0:02:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Like there's something more he has to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.31,0:02:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When you think about it, he doesn't\Nreally know that much about himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.63,0:02:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Like where he came from, why he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.01,0:02:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm babbling and we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go. Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The soccer game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We definitely don't want to miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.53,0:02:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.44,0:02:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy yourselves, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If the game ends early, feel free\Nto come back and help me sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.83,0:02:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who do you think's\Ngonna win? Win? Win what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.37,0:02:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth to Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.05,0:02:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The soccer game at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.87,0:02:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.93,0:02:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't really care\Nmuch about sports, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.55,0:02:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Future's told.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Fates unfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Step up, boy, and I'll reveal\Nthe secrets of your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.15,0:02:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:03:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you really see into the future? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.19,0:03:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Yugi? Taya,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe this fortune\Nteller can help me figure
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,out the fate of the\Nspirit inside the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, okay, but we really\Ndon't have that much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, boy, in order to tell your\Nfuture, I must hold a personal item.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.11,0:03:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your necklace will do nicely. My what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.63,0:03:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.67,0:03:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can't tell your fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.87,0:03:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.78,0:03:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but I need it in order\Nto properly read your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,aura to see what fate\Nhas in store for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.47,0:03:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You do want to know, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.41,0:03:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're faked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but only for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I don't know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's coming to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.95,0:03:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that this Millennium\NItem now belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.95,0:03:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:03:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.35,0:04:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.73,0:04:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll follow him this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You try to cut him off around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this, you creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I handed him my puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.15,0:04:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That thief wants me to follow him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.09,0:04:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be a trap, but\Nwhat choice do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose the spirit of the puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.95,0:04:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no sign of that\Nfortune teller anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Yugi's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Taya, what's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.39,0:04:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone stole Yugi's Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.81,0:04:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We split up to catch the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then don't let me detain you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.81,0:04:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep looking and I'll get some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.17,0:04:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Thanks, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No one shall have the\NMillennium Puzzle but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.55,0:04:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I want its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll track it down\Nwith my Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.91,0:05:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.11,0:05:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Trace the item's mystical energies\Nand lead me to the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If I control all the Millennium Items,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I will control power\Nunimaginable and I will
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,make certain that nobody stands in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.21,0:05:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way, Ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.05,0:05:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Yugi and his Millennium\NPuzzle are very close, very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.97,0:05:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya, but I can't have you and your sniveling\Nfriends interfering with my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever that guy was, he's leading\Nme like a rat through a maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.81,0:06:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would a thief want\Nhis victim to follow him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he really after?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The last arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Puzzle is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.05,0:06:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we're apart, I can sense it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.89,0:06:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.59,0:06:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.73,0:06:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, little Yu-Gi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.37,0:06:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I say, I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.71,0:06:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.77,0:06:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not going to be that easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want your puzzle back,\Nyou'll have to fight me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.67,0:06:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.89,0:06:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are going to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.19,0:06:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And the winner gets to\Nkeep your Millennium Idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A dueling arena?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you up to the challenge, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.55,0:06:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you want with\Nmy Millennium Puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I desire the power your\Nitem contains within,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but according to the rules\Nof its ancient magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to win it from you in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.27,0:07:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As for who I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.09,0:07:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,let's just say that I'm the one who shall
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.23,0:07:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,control your destiny as\NI have controlled others,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.19,0:07:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and that I am not unfamiliar with\Nthe power of a Millennium item.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, I understand more about their\Nhidden mysteries than you will ever know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There are ancient\Nsecrets buried within it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,of which you and even the spirit\Nthat inhabits it are unaware.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.15,0:07:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I will add it to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.33,0:07:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't duel you for my Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.93,0:07:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It already belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.69,0:07:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in my possession now, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then I accept your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.41,0:07:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have to duel, I'll need the\Nspirit of the puzzle to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can still connect with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.05,0:07:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely hear you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.87,0:07:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bond is weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to maintain contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.19,0:08:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I won't be able\Nto help you with this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.43,0:08:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to fight him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've never fought a duel without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.93,0:08:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I'm defeated,\NI'll lose you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.65,0:08:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trust yourself and your\Ndeck and you'll find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to believe in\Nthe heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.99,0:08:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Be very careful, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.61,0:08:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense a great evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No evil spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.15,0:08:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to lose your precious puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.43,0:08:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Yugi, I have seen\Nyour future, foretold your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.25,0:08:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and this duel will be your last.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.29,0:08:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about\Nthis duelist and now I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,have to face him alone for\Nthe highest stakes ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even have the gang to back me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.25,0:09:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I place the Celtic Guardian\Non the field in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made my play, now you make yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.67,0:09:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I place my monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.67,0:09:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have the courage\Nto face me head-on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.99,0:09:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.39,0:09:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one that better go on the\Noffensive if you hope to win back your puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I attack with my Celtic Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.29,0:09:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I\Nwanted you to do, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attack is activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.35,0:09:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of my cyber jaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This machine card destroys\Nevery monster on the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And it also requires us\Nto draw five new cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you've got up your\Npathetic sleeve this time, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:09:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a new strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.35,0:10:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm placing my monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm placing mine in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Mechanical Chaser\Nand Ground Attacker Batra.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,More machine cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this seems familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.87,0:10:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one player I know whose\Ndeck is filled with machine cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.69,0:10:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Bandit Keith!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.09,0:10:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would Bandit Keith disguise\Nhimself and steal my Millennium Puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time I saw him was when he battled\NJoey in the Duelist Kingdom tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke the rules, but Joey beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.49,0:10:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,When Pegasus found out Keith was\Ncheating, he ejected him from the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We never saw him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.47,0:10:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.19,0:10:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not Bandit Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I only speak through him since he's\Nbecome my mind-controlled slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.45,0:10:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this be? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,After Bandit Keith was ejected\Nby Pegasus from Duelist Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.49,0:10:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,he fought for his life against\Nthe harsh ocean waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My followers and I were on\Nthe way to retrieve some
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.75,0:11:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,very special items when we\Nfished him out of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.85,0:11:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always looking for\Nnew minds to control,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.45,0:11:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and Bandit Keith seemed like the\Nperfect puppet to do my bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.79,0:11:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And, as fate would have\Nit, he led me right to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.39,0:11:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,the boy who possesses the\Nlegendary Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.71,0:11:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it all sinking in now, little Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I have found you\Nafter all these years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I will stop at nothing to\Nmake your puzzle and all
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.35,0:11:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,of the ancient powers it\Npossesses within it my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.11,0:11:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never free yourself, Keith!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the duel continue!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.95,0:11:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Machine King in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My new monster gets an extra 100 attack
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,points for every machine\Nthat's on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.19,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's 300 more points!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.43,0:12:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Machine King, attack with jackpunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You may as well give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I play another card in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your defenses are useless\Nagainst my mechanical army.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially now that I'm adding\Nthis machine to my troop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mega Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.65,0:12:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It adds another 100 attack\Npoints to Machine King.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,making him even more deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Machine King, attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.25,0:12:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My stone soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.53,0:12:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All your defenses are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.01,0:12:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea of the power\Nyou're up against, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.09,0:12:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who this guy\Nis, I can't let him win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:12:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can I defeat\Nhim without the spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.35,0:13:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi may be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just point the way, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, any creep picks on our\Nbuddy has to deal with us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.49,0:13:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You volunteered to help\Nat the soccer game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, Coach, but we got an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya's cat has gotten sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to take it to the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.17,0:13:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, we need to help Fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.53,0:13:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize your\Nlittle kitty was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.57,0:13:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Save that little kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.41,0:13:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really a softy at heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't cool to mislead Coach Morty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.41,0:13:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.83,0:13:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Yugi needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we can find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.45,0:13:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.61,0:13:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.21,0:13:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:13:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.95,0:14:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no idea what he's up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.45,0:14:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,His millennium puzzle is as good as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.01,0:14:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have too much at stake in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.29,0:14:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.77,0:14:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Curse of Dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,In attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.19,0:14:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And I play Gaia, the Fierce Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I also use my polymerization card\Nto combine these two monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.01,0:14:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to create Gaia,\Nthe Dragon Champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This monster can take your machines apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.59,0:14:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Champion, attack Mechanical\NChaser with Double Dragon Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.59,0:14:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,With Mechanical Chaser gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.59,0:14:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,your Machine King loses 100 attack\Npoints and you lose 750 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but what will you do when I put\Nmy weaker monsters in defense
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,mode to protect them from your\NDragon Champion's attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.55,0:15:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And then play Machine Conversion Factory,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,a magic card that adds 300 attack and\Ndefense points to all of my machine cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.73,0:15:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've raised Machine\NKing's power even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.21,0:15:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, enough to\Noverpower your Dragon Champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Machine King, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Your offensive is over, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.01,0:15:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your champion destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.09,0:15:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made Keith's machine monster's\Nattack strength overwhelming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.85,0:15:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you stop resisting and\Njust hand over your puzzle to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.89,0:15:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the inevitable\Nconclusion to our game anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.69,0:15:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stop him somehow! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.81,0:15:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's assembled an army of the most rare\Nand powerful machines in Duel Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.01,0:15:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.92,0:15:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Summoned Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This gives me an idea, but first,\NI'll have to play a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.89,0:15:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your machines might be the\Nmost impressive I've seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but they're still made out\Nof metal, so I play Maki-u!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You think a little mist\Nwill destroy my machines?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't destroy them, but it will cause\Nthem to rust and lower their points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.43,0:16:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And the mist turns your machine monsters\Ninto one gigantic lightning rod,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Which makes them the perfect\Ntarget for my Summon Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.03,0:16:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Skull, use your lightning\Nstrike on Machine King now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.21,0:16:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Any more machines for the Junk Heap?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.81,0:16:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He plays much better than I had expected
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.93,0:16:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,without the spirit of\Nthe puzzle to aid him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but he has no idea of the\Npower he's up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My deck is full of rare monsters,\Nthe likes of which he's never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I'm through with Yuge,\Nhis Millennium Puzzle will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.27,0:16:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So, they went running\Ndown this alley? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, these arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.81,0:17:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you think Yugi tacked\Nthese things up here for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.89,0:17:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he had the time, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.51,0:17:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how are we gonna find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.77,0:17:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're the one who's stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.79,0:17:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna draw or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've picked the Graceful Charity card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,By placing this card on the table, I'm\Nable to draw three new cards from my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.41,0:17:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm confident that\Nthey'll be exactly the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.13,0:17:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,cards I need to end this\Nduel once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.63,0:17:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've dropped the ultra-rare\NZero Ritual card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.35,0:17:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's used to summon one of the\Nmost powerful monsters in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.99,0:17:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even heard of\Nthe Zero Ritual card before,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.91,0:17:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've got a sneaking\Nsuspicion that I'm about
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,to learn more about it\Nthan I really want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.77,0:18:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.29,0:18:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,For once I put Zero Ritual into\Nplay, this duel is over. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.91,0:18:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But activating a Ritual card\Ntakes more than just talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You also need to have the right\NMonster card in your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.01,0:18:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and what are the odds of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.13,0:18:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you finally understand the\Npower you are up against, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.91,0:18:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.89,0:18:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sierra Ritual sacrifices\Nmy two remaining monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to bring forth the\Ngreatest of my creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the instrument of your destruction,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,one of the strongest\Nbeasts and dual monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, Zera the manned!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Our battle ends here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to your Millennium Puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Zera, attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.83,0:18:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Zera obliterated my Summoned\NSkull, but I can't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:19:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get my Millennium Puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So, my Millennium Ring has led me\Nhere. The puzzle must be inside. Hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.93,0:19:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I also sense a dark presence from\Nthe Shadow Realm Seizing control
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.03,0:19:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Millennium Puzzle might be\Nmore interesting than I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.41,0:19:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.83,0:19:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, Yugi, say something, buddy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.15,0:19:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.27,0:19:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, little Yugi. With\NBandit Keith under my mind control,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.19,0:19:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll never win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.31,0:19:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Keith, your resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.39,0:19:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to end this\Nduel and take what's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.95,0:19:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.25,0:19:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to fight this monster with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could call on the\Nspirit and ask for his help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.17,0:19:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've lost contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.87,0:19:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Yugi's finally\Nfigured out it's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.81,0:19:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He will fall against my\Nsuperior monsters, and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.73,0:20:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the Millennium puzzle\Nwill be in my control
